- langfn/typescript/src/observability/storage.ts[114-141]

## Recommended Fix
Add an immutable, queryable tenant ownership field to trace records and trace queries, deriving it only from trusted authentication or session context. Require trace listing, direct trace lookup, and feedback operations to include that tenant predicate, ensure `findMany` applies it for HTTP reads, and reject feedback when the target trace belongs to another tenant.
