### What is covered

- **PlugFn catalog (required §1):** Finite 111-action / 13-provider set matching the issue (GitHub, Linear, Notion, ClickUp, Slack, Gmail, Drive/Docs/Sheets/Calendar, Jira, Outlook mail/calendar, OneDrive). New Google discovery adapters and Jira/OneDrive/Outlook/Gmail/Slack expansions. Shared lifecycle suite asserts catalog length 111, resource hints vs input fields, account bind, refresh, reduced-scope recheck, failed refresh, and disconnect (fixture provider HTTP, not live).
