- **LangFn Gemini (required §4, fixtures):** TypeScript package adopted from next `b21477fc9a32ae425c38a2de810b5a8705fc711f`. Native REST/SSE, tool IDs/continuation, system instructions, usage, fragmented SSE, cancellation, malformed args. Compatibility matrix updated. OpenAI/Anthropic adapters retained.
- **MemoryFn (required §5, local):** Injected/owned Postgres clients, explicit tenant/tag scope, revisions, tombstones, forget/retry, stale-index exclusion. Migrations + README. In-memory lifecycle tests plus recorded pgvector PostgreSQL 16 runs.
- **Package/runtime (required §6, local):** Workspace members for LangFn/MemoryFn/SecFn; `scripts/sfns4/` packed-consumer, catalog, worker, and Hyperdrive helpers; provenance notes (artifact set `e2ebf013…56aa`). Svelte SSR/hydration called out for 38 packed packages.
