## Issue description
Trace listing and feedback do not bind trace access to the authenticated tenant context, despite generation routes attaching that context to trace metadata. The authenticated traces endpoint therefore queries shared storage without tenant scoping, and feedback accepts trace IDs without validating ownership.

## Fix Focus Areas
